{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>EMD SW1500</strong> is a 1,500 hp (1,119 kW) diesel-electric switcher locomotive built by General Motors\u2019 Electro-Motive Division between 1966 and 1974. Designed to replace the SW1200, it quickly became a favorite across North America not only for yard switching, but also for road freight service thanks to its reliability and versatility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC brings the legendary SW1500 to life with <strong>five highly detailed variants</strong>, each authentically recreated with realistic physics, sounds, and visual fidelity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Liveries:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CR SW1500 Quality</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KCS SW1500 Grey Ghost</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MRL SW1500 Blue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NASA SW1500 Blue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SP SW1500 Bloddy Nose</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated <strong>driver\u2019s cabin</strong> with interactive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated wipers</strong> and functional cab details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for <strong>ACS coupling</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic <strong>running numbers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated cooling fans</strong> that react dynamically to engine load</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom headlights and ditchlights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic <strong>weathering skins</strong> for locomotive and bogies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic fuel consumption</strong> system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive\u00a0<strong>radio chatter</strong> for extra atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re shunting cars in a busy yard or hauling short freights on the mainline, the SW1500 offers an engaging and authentic switching experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refer Trainz Wiki for detailed information about the advances features. Search for 'Pro Train'.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053670?t=1760419276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053670?t=1760419276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053670/a85fde6e551561727e546cb171143bd39fb93f7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760419276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053670/a85fde6e551561727e546cb171143bd39fb93f7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760419276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>EMD SW1500</strong> is a 1,500 hp (1,119 kW) diesel-electric switcher locomotive built by General Motors\u2019 Electro-Motive Division between 1966 and 1974. Designed to replace the SW1200, it quickly became a favorite across North America not only for yard switching, but also for road freight service thanks to its reliability and versatility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC brings the legendary SW1500 to life with <strong>five highly detailed variants</strong>, each authentically recreated with realistic physics, sounds, and visual fidelity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included Liveries:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><